      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Update:\nThis is not just an issue with it moving the Avatar Preview, but it moves your whole section point!\nIf you look at the Video I attached to the OG post you can see (hardly) and hear that it looks / sounds like I'm hovering above things on the UI when moving my head. So it seems like my UI position is for some reason effected by my head rotation",
