  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-10T12:36:37.619Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nClicking on the Avatar Preview in VR to drag it and are rotating your head around will cause the Preview to spin around really fast.\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Open the Main Menu Avatar Tab in VR\n2. Click on the Avatar Preview to drag it\n3. Rotate your head (left to right and back)\nIf you do this you will notice the Avatar Preview spinning around really fast.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video of me showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/iwmacc",
